{"id":"n60941-1-7","stage":1,"title":"비디오 · 视频","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60941-1-7-1","ko":"우리 집 텔레비전이 고장 났나 봐.","zh":"看来我们家的电视坏掉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"텔레비전이","meaning":"电视，电视机","explanation":"텔레비전：电视，电视机；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"텔레비전","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27373","senseId":"1","lemma":"텔레비전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고장","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났나","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"f5472a609d9fa7b0","term":"텔레비전","zh":"电视，电视机","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3","entryId":"27373","definition":"接收电视台以电波传送的图像与声音后使其显示出来的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a1a759c684921a8d","term":"고장","zh":"故障","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3","entryId":"18856","definition":"机器或装置等不能正常运行。","pronunciation":["고ː장"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/92a43ff847237535f35b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60941-1-7-2","ko":"맞아. 소리는 잘 들리는데 비디오가 안 나와.","zh":"对啊，声音能正常听到，但是没有画面。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리는","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들리는데","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비디오가","meaning":"视频，录像","explanation":"비디오：视频，录像；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비디오","audio":"/audio/7bbccc10eeca9ee11efb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60941","senseId":"1","lemma":"비디오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나와.","meaning":"出来，播放出来","explanation":"나오다：出来，播放出来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"22","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]},{"id":"7bbccc10eeca9ee1","term":"비디오","zh":"视频，录像","audio":"/audio/7bbccc10eeca9ee11efb.mp3","entryId":"60941","definition":"电视中放映的与语音相应的影像。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出来，播放出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"可以听到或看到广播电视节目。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ef28a7a493c2046491fc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.18,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60941","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sour